# Firebase app config.
#
# GoogleService-Info.plist is NOT a secret - it ships inside the app binary,
# and its API key is restricted by bundle id. Google's own guidance is that
# it is fine to commit. It is left tracked here deliberately; uncomment the
# line below only if you would rather keep it out of the repository, and
# remember that a fresh clone then cannot talk to Firebase until it is added
# back by hand.
# GoogleService-Info.plist
#
# Note: Xcode put the file reference in the project's ROOT group, so the live
# copy is ./GoogleService-Info.plist, not NSSB/GoogleService-Info.plist. If
# you ever move it into the NSSB folder, move the Xcode reference with it.
